  (text "DAC NOTES\n- U301 PCM1794A (hardware control). Output 7.8 mA p-p per pin around ~-6.2 mA.\n- I/V 750R: 5.85 V p-p per leg around +4.65 V. Diff stage gain 0.5 -> ~2.07 Vrms single-ended.\n  Diff stage inputs are swapped (P from IOUT-, N from IOUT+) so the output is non-inverted.\n- FMT0/FMT1 straps: fit pull-down OR pull-up per PCM1794A datasheet Table for 24-bit I2S (VERIFY).\n- 4.7 uF film caps block DC into the volume pot. Use 0.1 % resistors in the diff stage."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "5ce847c4-39ef-506b-8f00-60a54e04915d")
  )
)
